- Workflow

    Alphabet Of Thought Programmer
        cycle
            after
            interval
            interval count
            timeout duration
            precision
        - Identify a need to remember more then one brain
            after: confusing time
            interval: every new thought on a unfamiliar subject
            interval count: until subject is scientifically instantiated
            timeout duration: unproductive to continue
            precision: all thoughts
        - Come up with new thought
            - Abstraction
            - Synthesis
            after: grappling with a subject
    Philosopher
        - When the language changes Epistemology makes sense
            - Aristotle
            - Logic
            
